@host = http://localhost:5078
@token = paste-accessToken-from-login

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "fencer@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!", "firstName": "Ada", "lastName": "Lovelace" }

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "fencer@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clubs
GET {{host}}/api/clubs?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a club (Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/clubs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Riverside Fencing Academy", "city": "Portland", "email": "info@example.com" }

### Schedule a class (Admin or Coach) - also pushes to devices following the club
POST {{host}}/api/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clubId": 1, "title": "Beginner Foil", "weapon": "Foil", "startsAt": "2026-11-01T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 90, "capacity": 12, "coachName": "Coach Kim" }

### Register this device for push
PUT {{host}}/api/notifications/installations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "installationId": "device-123", "platform": "Fcm", "pushChannel": "<fcm-registration-token>", "clubIds": [1] }

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
